---
description: Hybrid TDD — agree on test logics first, code and tests ship together
alwaysApply: true
---

# Development process

1. List the behaviors that need coverage before writing feature code.
2. Domain (cadence, budget, packer, ETAs): failing tests first, then code.
3. UI and callables: tests in the same PR as the code.
4. The suite must be green to commit. No known-failing tests.
5. Bug fixes ship with a regression test named after the bug.
6. Update docs in the same PR.
